<title>POLAND: Exbud wins PLN 32 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Exbud wins PLN 32 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Exbud SA said on Wednesday it had won a 31.9-million-zloty contract to build a shopping centre for the Polish unit of Dutch Macro Cash and Carry supermarket chain.</p>
<p>Exbud said in a statement the work, which would be carried out in southern town of Rybnik, would end by October 28, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
